<title>USA: New York physical copper market.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for October shipment were quoted at a nominal 94.00 to 94.50 cents a lb.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
